1
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:04,319
In the middle of the seventh month, at the third watch of the night,

2
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:06,840
the gates of hell open wide,

3
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:09,520
and the Yin energy is at its heaviest.

4
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:11,440
Do not knock on the ghost doors,

5
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,890
and do not touch the ghost windows.

6
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,259
Don't come any closer!

7
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,960
A face as white as a lotus.

8
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,479
Adjutant Zhang has arrived!

9
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:11,009
On behalf of Lord Huo, he presents a jade ruyi,

10
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,640
and a pair of South Sea coral screens.

11
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,420
Come, come.

12
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,680
Please, come inside.

13
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:24,090
Inspector Jiang Siyao of the Phoenix Police Department

14
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:25,010
presents

15
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:25,800
a...

16
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:29,240
a pink skeleton.

17
00:02:32,079 --> 00:02:33,810
This woman is quite something.

18
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:34,960
On her wedding day, she jinxed

19
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,360
her new husband to death.

20
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:38,900
She is a well-known demoness in the capital.

21
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,960
This play is about

22
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:43,240
Lord Wenchang's Precious Teachings Against Lust.

23
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,079
Beneath this makeup and powder

24
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:46,560
is nothing but dry bones.

25
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:47,440
Chief Lei,

26
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:50,320
wouldn't you say so?

27
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,320
Today is my birthday banquet.

28
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,300
I'm honored that Inspector Jiang

29
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,520
graced us with your presence.

30
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,520
It brings light to my humble dwelling.

31
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,520
Forgive me for not greeting you earlier.

32
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,380
Since it's Chief Lei's birthday,

33
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,260
I shall also present a grand gift.

34
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,360
Inspector Jiang,

35
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:22,610
please take a seat of honor.

36
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,360
Tell me,

37
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,490
what's going on?

38
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,200
Regarding the pile of bones in the suburban corpse pit,

39
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,329
there are new clues.

40
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,040
What clues?

41
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,600
The forensic doctor found

42
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,460
new white powder left on the body.

43
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,560
It smells like

44
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,720
it's suspected to be from the Jiuhe Gang,

45
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,920
the Jianing powder from the rouge shop.

46
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,460
This is the talcum powder used in cosmetics.

47
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:55,720
Is there a problem?

48
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,360
The Jiuhe Gang covers a hundred miles,

49
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,840
controlling 80% of the cosmetics business.

50
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,520
How could Chief Lei not know?

51
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,400
This is obviously a smuggled fake.

52
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,760
With just this bag of junk,

53
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:09,000
you want to frame my Jiuhe Gang?

54
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,760
This is going too far.

55
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,840
Inspector Jiang.

56
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,880
Officer Lin's face was smashed.

57
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,360
This is the white powder extracted

58
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,080
from his hair and clothes.

59
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,480
This talcum powder is from

60
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,640
Lin Jinwen's body,

61
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:34,560
and it's exactly the same as the talcum powder

62
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,780
sold in your Jianing Powder Shop.

63
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,240
You're making a baseless accusation,

64
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:41,040
saying the stuff on the victim

65
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,440
belongs to my Jiuhe Gang.

66
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:49,360
Chief Lei,

67
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,920
I know you killed him.

68
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,280
You, a dignified inspector,

69
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:01,720
dare to slander my Jiuhe Gang for selling fakes and smuggling,

70
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,320
and even pin this unsolved case

71
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:05,080
on me.

72
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,880
Is there anyone to judge this?

73
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:12,600
Excuse me.

74
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:15,560
I am untalented,

75
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,440
but I can identify

76
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,680
the authenticity of this bag of talcum powder,

77
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:20,400
and give you two a fair

78
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,520
and clear judgment.

79
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,320
How about it?

80
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,290
Where did this silly boy come from?

81
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,600
If there are no objections,

82
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,680
I'll start.

83
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,880
As for flour particles,

84
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:33,840
when mixed with water, the starch particles will dissolve,

85
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,560
and the gluten protein will become viscous,

86
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,840
which is what we commonly call kneading dough.

87
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,040
But please note,

88
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,570
this bag of powder does not dissolve in water.

89
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:46,440
According to the results of my experiment,

90
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:49,640
the main component of this powder is magnesium silicate.

91
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,520
It is insoluble in water,

92
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,960
with a pH of 7.1, hardness of 1, and specific gravity of 2.7.

93
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:55,960
That is to say,

94
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:57,000
this is talcum powder.

95
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,330
Just this bag of powder,

96
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,600
do we need your nonsense here?

97
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,480
The most important thing is,

98
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:03,560
the particle fineness of this powder is 45.

99
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,440
If it's 45,

100
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:08,320
isn't this a smuggled fake?

101
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:09,820
Where are you from?

102
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,760
I am

103
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:13,480
a mining engineer from Xinfeng Stronghold.

104
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:15,480
My name is Ye Shian.

105
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,840
A bandit?

106
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,920
If I believe a bandit's words,

107
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,120
how can I, Lei,

108
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,380
survive in the underworld in the future?

109
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,960
What about this?

110
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,320
Inspector Jiang,

111
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,280
if you are here to congratulate,

112
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:39,040
I have good food and drinks to entertain you.

113
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,210
If you are here to make trouble,

114
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,520
ask my brothers in the Jiuhe Gang

115
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,680
if they agree.

116
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:54,240
Is this the legendary dumdum bullet?

117
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,040
This is no ordinary bullet.

118
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,120
Because of its extremely high cost,

119
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,480
it is very rare in the country

120
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,480
and is usually only used by killers.

121
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,920
Brat,

122
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,760
who exactly are you?

123
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,880
Didn't I just say?

124
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:10,600
I am the mining engineer from Xinfeng Stronghold.

125
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,240
I don't care who you are.

126
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,800
You're unlucky to dare come to my hell.

127
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:15,600
Men,

128
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,160
catch him alive.

129
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:22,720
Here.

130
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,480
You know how to use it, right?

131
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,760
I should.

132
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,360
Go.

133
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:34,360
Go.

134
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:39,960
Go quickly.

135
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:40,680
What about you?

136
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,520
Run!

137
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:51,920
Run!

138
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:53,840
Fine.

139
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,260
After them!

140
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,720
A beautiful face

141
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,280
is but a flesh-covered skeleton.

142
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:10,480
A gorgeous appearance.

143
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,680
It is a sharp weapon for killing.

144
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:20,040
What was that floating in the sky just now?

145
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:20,920
Was it a ghost?

146
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:22,880
What are you doing in the Lei Mansion?

147
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,140
My Xinfeng Stronghold

148
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,410
lost a few brothers.

149
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,120
I suspect

150
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,210
it's related to the Jiuhe Gang.

151
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,760
Why should I believe you?

152
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,930
What was that sound?

153
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,500
Is it a human or a ghost?

154
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,000
Ningning, where are my reinforcements?

155
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,860
Senior Sister,

156
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,560
that Superintendent Li Chengrui of yours

157
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,160
is definitely not a good guy.

158
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,480
I took your token to ask him for reinforcements.

159
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,640
Guess what?

160
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,960
As soon as he heard it was the Lei Residence,

161
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,820
he refused to send anyone with me.

162
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,520
She called you Senior Sister.

163
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,240
So just now,

164
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:13,320
she was the one pretending to be the female ghost.

165
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,120
Yes.

166
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:16,080
Magic tricks.

167
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:19,840
Magic.

168
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:23,700
What are you doing?

169
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:26,200
Little bandit, how do you know so much?

170
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,640
Don't ask me why I know so much.

171
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,840
I know where the problematic bullets

172
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,840
and the talcum powder are.

173
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,000
If you take me to investigate the case,

174
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,800
I'll tell you.

175
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:35,960
Okay.

176
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,200
Starting today,

177
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,760
I'll make three rules with you.

178
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,560
Okay.

179
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,400
First, follow my orders.

180
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,640
Okay, Senior Sister.

181
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,440
What about the second and third?

182
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:49,840
Okay, got it.

183
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,720
Tell me when you want to.

184
00:09:58,680 --> 00:09:59,800
This is the place.

185
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,850
How did you find this place?

186
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,400
I followed the trail of

187
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:26,520
the missing brothers from Xinfeng Stronghold,

188
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,920
and found the Jiuhe Gang.

189
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,700
There was a guy named Boss Wang

190
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,120
acting suspiciously.

191
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,360
I tailed him for three days

192
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,890
before finding this place.

193
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,920
The killer shot from behind

194
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,250
and is left-handed.

195
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,680
Jinwen was murdered while investigating

196
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:44,120
the pile of bones case in the suburbs of the capital.

197
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:45,600
Then his body was taken by the killer

198
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,920
to the wedding venue

199
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,610
and thrown down from the second floor.

200
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:52,040
You can even tell he's left-handed?

201
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:12,050
Jinwen must have discovered some secret.

202
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,560
What secret did Lin Jinwen

203
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:16,360
discover that got him silenced?

204
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,080
The powder and bullets are still here.

205
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:30,640
Hengtong Company.

206
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,120
Isn't this

207
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:35,160
Uncle Jiang's business?

208
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,040
My dad.
